 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "cralon-333218@4.0",
   "gameId": "cralon-333218",
   "displayName": "Update 4.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-07-20T13:45:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Today we have several news to share with you.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are happy to announce that Assemble Entertainment is now the official PC publisher of Cralon. Assemble will support us with marketing, communication and visibility for the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There is also a new trailer, new artwork and an updated Steam store page presentation. We hope this gives Cralon a cleaner look and shows better what awaits you down in the shaft.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "And of course, there is also a new update.",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "With Update 4, we continued working on Cralon and improved several parts of the game. Thank you for your feedback, your suggestions and your patience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45514382/7d11c9ec50c08c6b1841ee9c8330fc1ca24a8187.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here is the changelog for today’s update",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "The UI of the whole game has been renewed: Main menu, trade, crafting, options, load/save menu, inventory, dialogues and journal",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Difficulty settings are now shown with text",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Missing sounds have been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Font and typo bugs have been fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And some other adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45514382/12cabcb9842a75789cc9fc175febe5615ff3ae13.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45514382/2ddb56c78283e543cd917eb84c4793c10cd3c55b.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45514382/eb7e874f94b7d8680844dbe67cd8dbe8b9783a24.jpg\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As usual, you can find support on our Discord.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can also leave feedback there or in the Steam Community Hub.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you like Cralon, please follow the game and leave a review. That would mean a lot to us and really helps us reach more players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the shaft!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jenny & Björn",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3440060?snr=1_2108_9__2107\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
