  {
   "id": "cralon-333218@3.0",
   "gameId": "cralon-333218",
   "displayName": "Update 3.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-06-15T08:08:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today we are happy to announce the third update for Cralon, featuring several requested new features and additional fixes! Thank you for your numerous suggestions and feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "So, here’s the Changelog for today's update for Cralon",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "A new Font has been implemented",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hit feedback has been improved with slight hitstop and stumble",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The menu now loads faster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Repeating dialogue can now be skipped faster",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final boss has increased health",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The map in the second level is now easier to find",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It is now easier to climb back out of the Maw",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some gates lacking collision have been removed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The word „Trade“ in the trade menu is now properly translated",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A few floating objects have been fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "More wooden sticks have been placed throughout the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A hole in the rocks of the second level has been closed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Items are now correctly added to the inventory after crafting",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The final boss's texture is now consistently dark.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and various other adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As usual you can find support or leave feedback on our discord https://discord.com/invite/dSCZgKy3cz",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "or in the Steam Community Hub.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you liked the game please follow and leave a review. That would be really appreciated and helps us spreading the word.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you in the mine!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jenny & Björn",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3440060?snr=1_2108_9__2107\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
