  {
   "id": "cralon-333218@2.0",
   "gameId": "cralon-333218",
   "displayName": "Update 2.0",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-05-07T08:51:45.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everybody!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today we are happy to announce the second update for Cralon! Thank you for your numerous suggestions and feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "So, here’s the Changelog for today's update for Cralon",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Monsters no longer hit you after death",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You’re no longer bleeding when parrying",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Grumps doesn’t continue walking on their spot anymore",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Attack sound now occurs earlier for improved readability",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Parrying time is slightly longer",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Toggle for sprinting with a controller has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dialog options are no longer logged if I select them simultaneously.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The “Big Mama” quest is now always completed when the giant spider is defeated",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Difficulty settings now save when using a controller",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The “Close” button for controllers has been fixed in the submenus",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The “Demon Hunter” achievement for destroying all statues has been fixed",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The axe will appear in your inventory after purchase",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Quest „Friendly Bertrayal“ also completes, when i play against Feral",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The healing amount for potions has been adjusted",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As usual you can find support or leave feedback on our discord https://discord.com/invite/dSCZgKy3cz",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "or in the Steam Community Hub.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you liked the game please follow and leave a review. That would be really appreciated and helps us spreading the word.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you inthe mine!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jenny & Björn",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3440060?snr=1_2108_9__2107\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
